  "identity": "grass_blade_sway",
  "title": "Grass blades swaying in travelling wind gusts",
  "purpose": "Vertex wind for grass and plant cards: blades bend more toward the tip, gusts travel across the field as moving noise in world space, each blade gets its own phase, and the blade is cut to a tapered shape with a root to tip gradient.",
